# HackTool - CACTUSTORCH Remote Thread Creation | T1055.012, T1059.005, T1059.007, T1218.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/create_remote_thread/create_remote_thread_win_hktl_cactustorch.yml
